<title>USA: Affinity Technology approves buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Affinity Technology approves buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, S.C. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Affinity Technology Group said on Monday that its directors had approved the repurchase of up to $2.0 million of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Affinity also said it expected to make the share repurchases periodically over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe Affinity's stock is undervalued at current levels and view this share repurchase program as an attractive investment opportunity,&quot; said company president Jeff Norris.</p>
</text>
